oop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/774ab338d60f115f90e4e35b0e7ef5d4.poster.avif?t=1745337580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/774ab338d60f115f90e4e35b0e7ef5d4.webm?t=1745337580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/774ab338d60f115f90e4e35b0e7ef5d4.mp4?t=1745337580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/c7b42a0e43fa3935cf019b5b30b1bb27.avif?t=1745337580\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a fully realized narrative</strong> full of\u00a0mystery, heart,\u00a0and\u00a0mortal terror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Navigate The Wren's peculiar\u00a0Dove Dreams</strong>, and uncover\u00a0multiple endings\u00a0that will affect both your\u00a0past and future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy a cinematic Dovecraftian adventure</strong> -- complete with\u00a0fully-voiced animated cutscenes\u00a0&amp; and a\u00a0rich original score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience a thrilling\u00a0psychological horror campaign</strong>\u00a0with\u00a0secrets\u00a0tucked into every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve puzzles, crack open mysteries</strong>, and uncover the\u00a0secrets\u00a0deep Appalachia holds\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover\u00a0beautiful environments, strange locations,\u00a0and\u00a0stranger locales</strong>\u00a0with\u00a0charmingly disturbing '00s-inspired visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Follow the quest of the hiking duo, Mark and Sean</strong>, on their quest to find the mythical\u00a0Ant Farm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/aab5c921450a657fe24258a2e55cbc75.poster.avif?t=1745337580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/aab5c921450a657fe24258a2e55cbc75.webm?t=1745337580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/aab5c921450a657fe24258a2e55cbc75.mp4?t=1745337580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "10 Dead Doves is a single-player, fixed-perspective narrative horror set in the heart of Appalachia. Avoid strange noises, collect lifelines, and creep through a forest that seems to hate you. Will you discover why the birds drop dead -- or leave behind nothing but footprints?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201c10 Dead Doves (A+ name) makes a strong statement with its staggeringly strong production value, intriguing mystery, and polished gameplay. Simply put, 10 Dead Doves is not to be missed.\u201d<br>Bloody Disgusting<br><br>\u201cIt truly takes something wild, weird, or just plain spectacular, to remind you that actually, yes, horror can still surprise you. 10 Dead Doves is very much its own thing from the off.\u201d<br>DreadXP<br><br>\u201c10 Dead Doves gripped me for the entirety of its runtime with a perfect balance between horror and comedy, and the most bewildering part is that I\u2019m not entirely certain it was trying to.\u201d<br>Pixel Die<br>",
